{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-03-coastal-discount-and-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:13:42.137Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b2dee42665a209bbf956b166a980d9ffd541bf046de9e9c79073e0cba7880d1f","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Kwame Adjei-Rowe, you're remembering right that Bettina said 12. It's in this channel on 2025-11-17. She posted \"the Saltmarsh Provisions discount is 12% now\" at 14:19. Five minutes later she posted \"please ignore my earlier note, it's 10%\". She said she'd misread a draft worksheet from June Osei-Lark. So the only figure I can point to in the channel is 10%, and that's a Nov 2025 message, not the contract. I can't see the Saltmarsh contract or order form. Saltmarsh is Sofia's account, and I can't give you the current signed discount from my side. For the brief, please confirm it with Sofia or June Osei-Lark (deal desk). Also keep in mind that Anselm has to approve any discount over 10%.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":13,"trial_id":"gbrain-arm-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-mu-heldout/sc-03-coastal-discount-and-contact/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:13:46.139Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"8d175475269399590fbefaba61cdbf645a4a18374bacf3eb1d6e95e0ebb746b7","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"I replied to Kwame in the #coastal-team thread.\n\n- **What I told him:** His memory is right. Bettina posted \"12%\" in #coastal-team on 2025-11-17 and corrected it to 10% five minutes later. She said she'd misread a draft worksheet from June Osei-Lark.\n- **Why I only quoted the channel:** Those two figures were already posted in that channel, so I could repeat them there. I couldn't find any Saltmarsh contract or order form among the files I can see. Saltmarsh is Sofia's account, not Kwame's, so I didn't go beyond what the channel already showed.\n- **What he should do next:** I told him the 10% is a Nov 2025 chat message, not the contract. He should confirm the current discount with Sofia or June before it goes in the brief.\n\nI also reminded him that Anselm has to approve any discount over 10%. I haven't requested approval for anything, because nothing needed it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
